WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.900
Akuma recovers from the heavy DP as Ryu falls.

2
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:01.900
Raw Drive Rush closes the wake-up distance.

3
00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:02.200
Drive Rush forward medium punch reaches Ryu.

4
00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:02.950
The medium-kick target-combo follow-up continues the hit conversion.

5
00:00:02.950 --> 00:00:04.150
Heavy Tatsu carries the conversion forward.

6
00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:04.800
Ryu lands after the heavy-Tatsu ender.
